window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>You know that little voice in your head that whispers...<i> this man could ruin you?</i><br>Mine screamed.<br><i>And, </i>I told it to shut up.<br>Because the man in the devil mask wasn’t just danger—<br>He was exactly what I wanted.</b><br><br>I came to the club for one reason: to lose myself.<br>Behind the mask, I could be anyone... <i>forget my name, my past, my pain.</i><br><br>But then I saw him.<br>Tall, dangerous, and impossible to ignore.<br>His devil mask couldn't hide the intensity of his gaze or the raw power radiating from every inch of him.<br>He wasn’t like the others—no trust fund brat or pampered predator.<br><br>This man was built to take what he wanted, and his eyes told me I was next.<br>I should’ve walked away.<br>But instead,I raised my glass, smiled beneath the mask, and silently dared him to claim me.<br><br>That night was supposed to be a game, a distraction, a fleeting moment in the chaos of my life.<br>I didn’t know his name.<br>He didn’t know mine.<br><br>One moment, I was hunting for a thrill.<br>The next, I was fighting for my life.<br>Drugged and trapped with a killer, I thought it was the end.<br>Until he found me.<br><br>The man in the devil mask didn’t just save me—he destroyed the one who tried to take my life.<br>I didn’t ask for his name. He didn’t ask for mine.<br>That night, he left me breathless in more ways than one.<br><br>But fate has a twisted sense of humor.<br><br>Five years later, I have a son with the said ‘Devil.’<br>The man whose voice still haunts my dreams.<br><br>And now, I’ve stepped into a world I swore I’d destroy.<br>Because I just found out the man I’ve sworn to kill for my brother’s death—Leonid Kuznetsov.<br><br>Pakhan of the Kuznetsov Bratva.<br><br><i>The Raven. </i><br><br><b><i>Is also the father of my child.<br><br>Dear Readers, </i></b><br><b>🌹Onyx Heart is Book 1 of the Kuznetsov Bratva Series, featuring a dark mafia romance with a secret pregnancy and a single mother. The story continues in Book 2, Eclipse Heart.<br><br>Warning: </b>This dark mafia romance will make you laugh, scream, cry, and maybe throw your Kindle (just don’t blame me). Expect scorching chemistry, savage twists, and a whole lot of “Oh no, they didn’t!” moments. Proceed with caution—and wine, or coffee/tea<b>.🖤</b><br>"; 
